	(text "GROUNDING THE MOUNTING HOLES -- recommendation, not yet applied.\nH1-H4 are Mechanical:MountingHole + MountingHole_3.2mm_M3: NPTH, no pad, no net. Recommend\nconverting them to MountingHole_Pad + MountingHole_3.2mm_M3_Pad_Via tied to GND, because:\n  - ESD: the station is handled outdoors and its SMA/coax shields already land on board GND;\n    a plated, stitched hole gives a low-inductance path into any metal standoff / frame.\n  - RF: plated holes stitched to every ground layer stop the board edge near the LTE antenna\n    and the four SMA launches from behaving as slot/edge radiators (stackup is 4-layer).\nAgainst: with a metal frame, a grounded hole plus the coax shields can form a ground loop.\nMiddle path when the enclosure is chosen: plated pad holes, each to GND through a 0R/DNP pad\nso the bond can be opened per hole. Enclosure is plastic/RF-transparent by assumption\n(decisions.md), so today nothing metal contacts the holes -- decide with the enclosure."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 175.26 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "11249134-b856-4fa0-a015-29219b18a8ba")
	)
	(text "Three global fiducials, top side (all SMD parts are top side today). Place non-collinear at three\ncorners (an L, not a line) so the pick-and-place camera can solve rotation AND skew. Asymmetric\nplacement also stops a board being loaded 180 deg rotated. If parts are ever put on B.Cu,\nadd FID4-FID6 on the bottom. Fine-pitch local fiducials (LGA-12/14 sensors at 0.35-0.5 mm,\nDW3210 QFN-40 at 0.4 mm) are NOT added: check the assembler -- JLCPCB/PCBWay generally only\nneed globals -- and add locals beside U10/U11 if they ask."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 175.26 105.41 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "152f6666-ca74-4a4f-b585-c5cec8fbed32")
	)
	(text "Mechanical -- 4x M3 mounting holes (H1-H4), 3 fiducials (FID1-FID3)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 100.584 50.546 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.5 2.5)
			)
		)
		(uuid "49c37a65-ca55-4f59-895c-7004cc9fa745")
	)
	(text "Fiducials -- 3 global (FID1-FID3)"
